      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE SERENADE (3) flew the lids with a fast early split and led until late but gathered in when a 0.8 lengths second at this track over 350m in 19.25. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Deserves serious consideration. GOLDSTAR JOBLIN (2) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 2 length second (19.38) over 350m at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Bold showing expected. MOLLETES (7) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 16.95 beating Goldstar Henry. Sure to measure up. SLEEK KARMA (1) deserves plenty of thought over this trip.",
